WEBVTT

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:17.250
I don't handle summer very well.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:21.210
Things just get so chaotic.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.040
Aw jeez!

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:28.130
Gosh. I wonder what it's like up there.

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:34.040
As I pondered that question...

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:45.130
I got my first visitor in a long time.

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:54.540
Home is Where You Find It

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:53.250
He came right down to me!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:32.540
Take this!

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:33.460
Hey!

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:34.920
Here it comes!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:35.960
Nice!

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.460
Now this is my kinda view!

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:40.630
This place is totally filled with foxy babes!

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:41.880
Hey, Moroboshi.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:42.580
What is it?

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:45.630
Impressive, no?
The pool at my family's hotel can't be beat.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:47.580
Since when can pumpkins talk?

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:49.710
Who are you calling a pumpkin, dammit?!

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:51.210
Boy!

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:54.670
Tell me, do I also appear to be
a vegetable to you?

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:57.290
Half-naked dudes are the LAST thing
I wanna be looking at!

00:02:57.290 --> 00:02:59.460
Everybody that's not a hot chick
is now a vegetable.

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:01.250
SLAM

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:01.880
Quit turning people into produce!

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:02.830
Here it comes!

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:05.880
Pass it here!

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:07.250
C'mon!

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:11.960
This world is full of too much stuff
that makes me cringe.

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:13.290
Thanks for waiting, guys!

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.250
We finally found you!

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.330
This place is so huge
that we almost got lost.

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:20.880
Hello, Miss Lum!

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.630
I'm digging that swimsuit you have on!

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:26.170
Although with a body like that,
you'd look good in anything!

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:27.790
Hey, Mendo.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:32.750
Wah! You look beautiful Miss Shinobu!
Just stunning!

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.960
Simmer down over there, kids.

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:37.210
This is not the place for your rowdy antics.

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:40.040
I know that voice...

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:42.630
It certainly sounds familiar.

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:46.250
You could hurt someone
hurling beach chairs like that.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:47.710
It's Nurse Sakura!
It's Sakura!

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.420
Good grief.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:53.330
There is never any peace and quiet
when you kids are around.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:58.000
I'm so glad I decided against taking a trip
to our vacation home in Florida.

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:01.540
This is the first time I've seen
Sakura showing skin like that...

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:03.630
Now my heart is set.

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:05.420
We should get married, baby!

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:05.960
SMACK

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:09.500
Why does your train of thought
always go totally off the rails?!

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:15.710
Helpless buffoon.

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:18.880
Wow! I want to have one, too!

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:20.040
Oh really?

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:22.920
Well, I was just thinking about
ordering some more myself.

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:23.750
Lum!

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:25.210
Would you care for a parfait?

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:32.630
My darling hasn't come back up for air...

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:33.380
Huh?

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:34.830
He's paying the price for his actions.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.420
Sakura's punch might have been too much.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.210
He could be drowning!

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.210
FOOSH

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:46.130
Hold on, there's no need to rush!

00:04:46.130 --> 00:04:47.420
Oh! There he is!

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:50.380
Just stay, okay?
I'll go and prepare us some tea!

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:57.250
You came all the way down here,
so please take a load off!

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.290
TAP

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.290
TAP

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:03.130
To be honest, I don't do well
when things get loud and rowdy.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:04.540
That being said,

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:04.500
TAG!

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:07.170
I still enjoy company
every once in a while.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:09.460
Here, your tea.

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:12.710
Huh?

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:15.630
You became quite adorable all of a sudden!

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.130
Holy cow...

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:27.460
Another, please.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:29.250
Uh, r-right away, ma'am!

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:31.750
BLARGH!

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.750
Hey! Calling all Demonbusters!

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:36.040
Great, the rabble rouser is back.

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:39.040
A-a-a-a-a-at the bottom of the pool!
I saw a demon!

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:40.040
What?

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:42.790
Yeah, right! Don't start with
your bullcrap, Moroboshi!

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:44.580
If you don't believe me,
then come see for yourself!

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:46.170
Shall we take a look?

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:49.330
Well, as I recall, you're the expert
at diving underwater.

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:51.500
Oh? That's news to my ears.

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:53.500
It's because you're so cray-sea!

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:56.960
THWOK!

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:55.750
I saw that stupid pun coming a mile away!

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:56.960
Don't thwok me.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.960
Hold on, let me get out some snacks.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.420
Uh oh. I seem to have run out.

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:06.080
Well, I'll go grab some
from the store up top.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:07.540
Please wait here.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.250
Don't go leaving now!

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:15.210
You better not be fibbing about this.

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:17.580
The reputation of my family's hotel
is on the line here!

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.540
And I'm telling you
that's about to get shattered!

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:26.170
Oh, pardon me.

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:27.670
Same here! Sorry about that!

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:35.210
Upsy-daisy.

00:06:35.210 --> 00:06:36.580
What in the world is that?!

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:39.630
M-m-monster attack!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.830
Good gracious.

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:45.880
It's always so loud up here.

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:49.750
BLUB

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:49.750
BLUB

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:54.380
Miss Lum!

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:57.750
There's nothing down here!

00:06:58.170 --> 00:07:00.830
It was here earlier!

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:03.040
Please hang in there!

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:05.380
I need air...

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:09.500
Yummy.

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:13.000
It took some time to pick what I wanted.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.290
Huh?

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:16.460
Seems like it's gotten busy down here.

00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:19.960
There's nothing... yummy... need air...

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.750
Is she talking to herself?

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:23.830
Or maybe I have even more visitors?

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:28.290
Oh my! Look at all the people!

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:31.250
What a pickle. I might not have enough snacks.

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:32.330
Hey!

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:32.330
Whoa!

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:32.330
Ah!

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:32.330
Gasp!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.330
Hm.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:34.000
Tag, tag, tag, tag!

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:37.000
Must have ants in her pants.

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:40.710
Ah, please make yourselves at home.
I'll get some tea for you right now.

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:42.540
No. No. No.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:44.000
On, on, on?

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:48.080
You must leave now!

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:49.880
Now you mustard leaves?

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:55.460
YOU MUST

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:55.460
LEAVE NOW

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:55.460
Whaaaaat?!

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:57.830
B-b-b-but why?! Please explain!

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:01.420
What reason could there be?
I haven't done anything!

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:01.920
GUH...

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:04.210
Guh? What does that even mean?!

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:05.830
You're not making any sense!

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:08.080
Please explain why I have to leave!

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:12.080
I'm just living down here in secret and
there's nothing wrong with that!

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:16.420
It's a sea monster!

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:18.750
Yeek! Somebody help!

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:20.500
Huh? What's going on?

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:23.250
Why are you all freaking out?

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:25.080
Do you get it now?!

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:28.080
Having you around is causing
big problems for my hotel!

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:30.380
B-big problems, you say?

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:34.580
Well, shucks. I was just minding
my own business...

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:36.170
I feel sorry for the little guy.

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:37.460
Same here.

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:40.130
C'mon, you can afford to
take care of one demon, right?

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:41.130
NO WAY!

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:43.460
Oh please have a heart!

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.880
I'll pay you back by cleaning,
or doing laundry, whatever it takes!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.080
I SAID NO AND THAT'S FINAL!

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:51.540
Awww...

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:54.750
He's always a stick in the mud.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:56.460
Try not to hate him.

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:58.170
What will you do now?

00:08:58.170 --> 00:08:59.830
Good question.

00:08:59.830 --> 00:09:04.460
I suppose I'll search for a place where
I can live quietly without troubling anyone.

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:05.540
Farewell.

00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:08.670
I hope you can find a place soon...

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:14.540
Thanks for everything.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:17.710
Take care!

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:19.500
Good luck finding a place!

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.710
We're home!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.380
Whew, I'm beat.

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:33.960
Yeah, but that was so much fun!

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:35.420
Hey, Mom! Food ready?

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:38.630
Welcome back. Go and take a bath first.

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:40.170
Ugh, fine.

00:09:45.170 --> 00:09:47.630
Oh! Howdy there, new neighbor!

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.250
KA-THUUUD!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.880
This place is the best!

00:09:59.630 --> 00:10:01.290
This weather is perfect!

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:03.250
The best day to hit up the beach!

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:05.500
We're heading out!

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:06.540
Ataru!

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.790
Hang on just a moment.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:11.380
What is it? You gonna give me
some fun money?

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.830
Don't be silly.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:16.170
I need you to throw this away for me
while you're at the beach.

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:17.210
What?

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.250
Hello again.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.250
It's the pool demon!

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:22.630
You're still here?

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:23.790
He sure is!

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:26.880
He's been taking up camp in
our bathtub for over a month now.

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:29.790
What do you need me for? Just leave it
next to the phone pole or something!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.210
There's no way I'm leaving this
anywhere in our neighborhood!

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:33.710
It would be mortifying!

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:35.170
Go on. You take it.

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:39.330
This is some hefty luggage...

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:40.920
Time for you to move again, huh?

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:42.790
Excuse me, madam?

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:45.130
What about my dresser and table?

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:47.790
Send us a postcard when you've
found a new place to live.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.290
Then I'll ship them to you.

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:51.920
What a huge relief!

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:54.250
You're a real kind-hearted person, madam.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.290
Stay safe out there!

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:58.750
Thanks for letting me stay with you!

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:01.540
I'll be waiting for that postcard!

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:04.830
Marine Garbage Disposal

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:19.790
This might be a good place...

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:37.170
There are so many people here!

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:39.580
Nice to see you again, everyone.

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:42.630
Oh? You're being
tossed out again, I take it?

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:44.130
Have you been doing okay?

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:45.830
Yes, quite well!

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:48.420
Well, I guess we should get going.

00:11:48.420 --> 00:11:49.580
Sounds good.

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:51.500
Good luck.

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:53.880
Okay, I'm gonna go find
a place to chuck him.

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:55.500
Come back soon!

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:57.380
Farewell, everyone!

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:00.830
Gosh, that poor little guy...

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:03.250
He managed to live comfortably
in a pool of all places.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:05.290
I'm sure he'll be fine anywhere.

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:08.080
Restaurant

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:10.920
I have to say, this place is pretty nice!

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:14.630
It's nice to know that you have
decent taste, Tsubame.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.920
Well, we haven't been on a date in forever.

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.920
And I heard the food here is amazing.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:19.920
Oh?

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:26.750
Here is the appetizer from our
Hellacious Full Course.

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:29.250
It's spaghetti drenched in plenty of oil.

00:12:29.250 --> 00:12:30.670
So much food...

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:33.210
How are two people
supposed to eat it all?

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:37.170
If you manage to finish the whole course,
then it comes free of charge!

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:38.540
Wow!

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:44.540
Whoa...

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:46.080
No way...

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:50.750
I'm all done!

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:52.500
GOBBLE

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.960
I'm so glad that you enjoyed it.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:56.750
When is the next dish coming?

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:58.830
Th-thank you for waiting.

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:01.170
This is our canyon steak
with butter sauce.

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:03.210
Wow. Looks delish!

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:05.790
We also have a roast turkey platter.

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:08.000
And our tropical dynamic parfait!

00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:11.500
Is this some kinda eating contest?

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:13.630
She's just wolfing it all down...

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:17.250
Check it out!

00:13:17.250 --> 00:13:18.420
That's nuts!

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:20.630
Something's got everybody worked up.

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:22.880
I'd like to find a place where
there are no people around.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:23.960
Good idea.

00:13:32.290 --> 00:13:33.790
This will work.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:36.000
Cool. Then I'll be going now.

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:37.960
Sure. Goodbye!

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:40.330
Live a good life!

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:42.710
Thanks for everything!

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:53.960
In the end... I'm still lonely.

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:57.710
Why don't we take a swim around here?

00:13:57.710 --> 00:13:58.540
Huh?

00:13:58.540 --> 00:13:59.790
That sounds nice.

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:03.790
You ate enough for an army,
but still look as slim as ever.

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:06.500
That was a light meal,
as far as I'm concerned.

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:10.830
It's our first time coming to
the beach together like this, huh?

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:13.170
You're right.

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:17.540
Huh? I could swear I've seen
that lady somewhere before...

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:20.330
It took a long time
for my uncle to come around

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:22.330
and give our engagement his blessing.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.080
I'm glad it finally happened.

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:26.670
Oh, that's right! I met her at the pool!

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:28.080
I should say hello!

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:29.290
Hey... hrmf!

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:31.210
Shut up, you idiot!

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:30.330
PEEK

00:14:31.210 --> 00:14:32.920
Oh, it's you. Welcome back.

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:34.670
You're lacking in the manners department.

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:36.170
Let me show you how it's done.

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:37.290
Uh, okay!

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:40.500
It's so peaceful.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:43.250
The lack of people makes it
very relaxing, indeed.

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:45.460
Lesson one. Don't raise your voice.

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:46.330
Right!

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:49.210
It's been hard ever since you
became a school nurse,

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:51.420
because it's kept you so busy.

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:54.500
Not to mention my nosy uncle
never stops following me around.

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:57.250
But today, we have each other to ourselves.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.000
And nobody's watching right now...

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.750
Hold up.
Isn't that Nurse Sakura over there?!

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:06.630
But who's that guy with her?

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.170
They totally took like a couple out on a date.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:10.630
Oh man, no way!

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:13.250
Jeez, when are they gonna
get this show started?

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:17.380
Oh! They started holding hands!

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:19.380
Should we make our move?

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:20.460
Shh! Keep quiet!

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:24.210
Must be nice to be him.
Getting to keep a cute pet and stuff.

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:26.580
I'm sorry, Pochi.

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:31.630
Fate brought us together, but then
mom said that we couldn't keep you...

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:36.210
But if I leave you where
lots of people are around,

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:38.330
then someone will definitely take you in!

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:41.420
Now he's grabbing her shoulders!

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.250
That's it! Go in for the kill!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.380
Omigosh!
He grabbed her by the shoulders!

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:47.330
What move is he gonna make next?

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:49.080
Just watch and we'll find out!

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:52.460
At last, we can enjoy ourselves.

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:53.460
Yeah.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:55.000
Sakura...

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:56.130
Tsubame...

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:00.460
Wait a second.

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:01.790
Huh? What's the matter?

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:05.790
I just can't shake the feeling that
we're being watched by somebody.

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:07.380
SWISH!

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:10.290
But I don't see anyone around.

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:11.830
It's just your imagination.

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:13.000
I guess so.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:15.250
Okay, back to where we left off...

00:16:17.380 --> 00:16:18.580
Tsubame...

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:21.670
C'mon! Seal the deal!

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:23.330
Sakura...

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:25.540
Just take it nice and easy!

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:27.170
Squee! It's so romantic!

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.750
I'm on the edge of my seat!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.830
Staaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaare.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:32.830
STARE

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.580
Sorry for the interruption!

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:42.830
Please continue like nothing happened!

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:44.000
No freakin' way!

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:46.290
Neener, neener!

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:48.080
You slowpoke!

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:49.580
Four-legged loser!

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:51.290
Reptiles are lame!

00:16:51.580 --> 00:16:53.170
This is a bad spot.

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:55.880
Pochi would get harassed by
those kids if they found him.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:00.670
Dammit! We almost got to see
something really juicy!

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:02.790
This all your fault, you know!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:04.790
Please give me a home

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:04.790
My name is Pochi

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.330
My apologies, but I'm nearsighted, you see.

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:08.040
I've been thinking about getting
some glasses soon though.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:10.710
Wish that could be us.
They seem like they're having fun.

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:14.080
I really don't want to abandon you.

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:18.500
Gather around, everyone!
Let's enjoy lunch together!

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:20.710
Please help yourselves!

00:17:20.710 --> 00:17:22.790
Dude, none of this belongs to you.

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:25.290
Oh come now,
let's not sweat the small stuff!

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:27.880
I came here to be thrown away.

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:31.750
So I just want to make some nice memories
with you before the end comes.

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:34.920
FLAWOMP...

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:37.790
Th-there's no need to be gloomy!

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:39.420
Please keep your spirits up!

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:41.630
That's right!
This isn't some kinda funeral!

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:42.790
Exactly!

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:43.920
Good point!

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:46.040
Alright! It's time to chow down!

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:47.920
Cheers!

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:50.000
Here, you can have my sandwich!

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:51.380
Why thank you!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:53.790
Wow! I love these riceballs!

00:17:55.330 --> 00:17:57.380
Oh my! It's delicious!

00:17:57.830 --> 00:18:00.000
My last supper, I suppose...

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.040
Oh gosh!

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.500
Don't get so down in the dumps!

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:10.170
Come on, there's still food left!

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:14.670
You know, I'm starting to think he's making us
all feel guilty like this on purpose...

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:15.960
This is exhausting.

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:17.630
Get your fill and then let's go!

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:18.540
Yessir!

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:20.500
I'm sure you'll have
plenty of fun in the sea!

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:24.580
I think those people over there
might give you a good home, boy.

00:18:25.380 --> 00:18:27.790
Pochi. I'm going to leave you here, okay?

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:31.830
Make sure they treat you right.

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:34.630
Goodbye.

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:41.830
Hey! I had just had a brilliant idea!

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:44.040
Okay. Hop inside this box here.

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:44.830
Sure.

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:46.380
Now put this on it.

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:52.500
Please give me

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:52.500
a home

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:49.920
Looks exactly like an abandoned pet.

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:52.500
The cardboard box really helps sell it!

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:54.080
Okay, you ready to go?

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:54.960
Yep!

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:56.380
Pochi...

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:58.830
Take care.

00:19:01.000 --> 00:19:02.080
Hup.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:05.710
They already decided to
take you home with them, huh?

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:10.630
That's great, Pochi.

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:16.580
This was for the best.

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:20.290
I know you'll be happy, Pochi...

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:23.290
Pochi...

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.000
Pochi...

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:26.750
Pochi...

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:28.040
Pochi...

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:29.670
Pochi!

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:33.290
Okay! From now on, you're "Pochi"!

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:37.500
Pochi! Here, boy, this way!

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:40.460
The rain just won't let up, huh?

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:43.540
We're friends forever.

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:51.710
Pochi...

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:56.250
This sucks...

00:19:57.080 --> 00:19:58.710
I just can't do it!

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:00.880
POCHIIIII!

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:04.290
I'm sorry, mister!

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:08.540
I'm gonna take care of Pochi myself!

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:09.790
Hey!

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:11.580
That kid just snatched it away.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.500
But what's a "Pochi"?

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:15.170
Look at this, guys!

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:18.580
I found a cardboard box
just lying over here.

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:19.960
What on earth could it be?

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:24.250
Please give me a home

00:20:20.080 --> 00:20:24.250
My name is Pochi

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:24.250
"Please give me a home.
My name is Pochi."

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:26.540
Oh no! That boy must have
taken the wrong box!

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:28.210
He's in for a shock when he gets home.

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:29.750
That demon's gonna end up
on the street again.

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:38.380
What a surprise.

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:40.250
I didn't realize you all
came to the beach, too.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:41.710
It's Cherry...

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.210
Everything might work out.

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:45.380
That kid was crazy enough
to deal with this geezer, after all.

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:48.790
Props to that boy.
He's a real philanthropist.

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:51.170
I was living the good life.
Crap! Now we're stuck with
this pain in the butt!

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:52.250
Crap! Now we're stuck with
this pain in the butt!

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:54.130
Ataru!

00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:56.420
Ataru!

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:59.250
Look. This just came in the mail.

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:01.460
I thought it would be good
if you saw it, too.

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:04.000
What is it?

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:08.170
Greetings, I'm writing to you
from my new home.

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:12.670
Thanks to all the good times we had,
I've really come to enjoy summer.

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:14.290
From Pochi.

00:22:46.540 --> 00:22:51.330
Transfer Student Close Call...

00:22:46.540 --> 00:22:51.330
Farewell Party Close Call...

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:48.580
On the next episode of Urusei Yatsura!

00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:51.330
Guess what?
Your darling is going to be mine!
